<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <ul class="features">
      <li><b>Live TV with a real guide</b>Browse by category, and search for a show across every channel.</li>
      <li><b>Movies and Series</b>A home page with rows, a watchlist, and resume where you left off.</li>
      <li><b>Rewind live TV</b>Pause or jump back on live channels.</li>
      <li><b>Subtitles and live captions</b>In your language, with subtitles from SubDL when a title has none.</li>
      <li><b>Several sources</b>Xtream logins and M3U playlists together, in the order you set.</li>
      <li><b>Streams that recover</b>Provider drops reconnect on their own.</li>
      <li><b>Themes</b>sbtl plus Catppuccin, Gruvbox, Nord, Tokyo Night and more.</li>
      <li><b>Move your setup</b>Export sources and settings to one locked file and import it on another computer.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
